<title>UK: UK's Fortune Oil invests in China oil depot.</title>
<headline>UK's Fortune Oil invests in China oil depot.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil distribution group Fortune Oil Plc said on Monday it had agreed to invest $6.5 million in new oil depot facilities at Jiangment in the Guangdong province of China.</p>
<p>Fortune said the depot would be the largest storage facility in the Jiangmen region with 40,000 cubic metre capacity and would be the sole supplier of fuel oil to the Xi Jiang power plant.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
